flowchart TD
    A([👤 Passenger Opens Web / Android]) --> B[Enter Pickup Location\nEnter Destination\nOptional Landmark]
    B --> C[Select Vehicle Type\nMINI · SEDAN · SUV]
    C --> D[⚡ Click SmartMatch & Calculate]
    D --> E[Backend POST /drivers/smartmatch\nFare estimated using formula\nBase₹80 + Distance×15 + Duration×2.5 × Multiplier]
    E --> F[SmartMatch Algorithm Scores All Available Drivers\nDistance 30% · ETA 25% · Rating 20%\nAvailability 15% · Vehicle Match 10%]
    F --> G[Top Ranked Driver Recommended\nAlternatives Shown with Scores]
    G --> H{Passenger Accepts?}
    H -- No --> C
    H -- Yes --> I[Confirm Booking\nPOST /api/rides]
    I --> J[Backend Creates Ride Record\nGenerates Secure 4-Digit PIN\nAssigns Selected Driver]
    J --> K[REQUESTED → DRIVER_ASSIGNED]
    K --> L[🔒 Active Ride Screen Opens\nPIN Displayed Prominently]
    L --> M[Passenger Checks Driver Card\nVerifies License Plate & Model\nPOST /rides/:id/verify-vehicle]
    M --> N{Vehicle Matches?}
    N -- ❌ Mismatch --> O[Safety Event Logged\nVEHICLE_MISMATCH\nSafety Center Alerted]
    N -- ✅ Match --> P[Passenger Gives PIN to Driver]
    P --> Q[Driver Enters PIN\nPOST /rides/:id/verify-pin]
    Q --> R[STARTED]
    R --> S{Ride in Progress}
    S --> T[Route Deviation Monitor\nPOST /rides/:id/route-check\nAlert if > 150m deviation]
    S --> U[Safety Center Available\nSOS · I Dont Feel Safe\nShare Live Trip]
    T --> V[Complete\nPOST /rides/:id/complete]
    U --> V
    V --> W[COMPLETED]
    W --> X[POST /rides/:id/rating\nPassenger rates driver 1–5 ⭐]
    X --> Y([✅ Ride History Updated])

    style A fill:#06D6A0,color:#0B132B
    style Y fill:#06D6A0,color:#0B132B
    style O fill:#EF476F,color:#fff
    style R fill:#3A86FF,color:#fff
    style W fill:#06D6A0,color:#0B132B
